            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in v1.4.6</h3>
<h4>Changed</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Refined the memory map with cleaner slice edges, subtler hover/selection states, and clearer labels so usage is easier to read at a glance without visual heaviness.</li>
    <li>Tightened the sidebar layout and interactions for a denser, more native process list with cleaner hover/selection behavior and less wasted space.</li>
    <li>Improved the center detail view and bottom summary strip so key memory numbers remain readable in smaller window sizes.</li>
    <li>Polished light and dark mode behavior plus menu bar presentation, removing mismatched surfaces and text treatments for a more consistent look across contexts.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Fixed</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Resolved chart and selection synchronization issues, including sidebar-to-chart highlighting and dark mode label rendering for free memory.</li>
</ul>
