            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in v1.4.0</h3>
<h4>Changed</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Dramatically reduced CPU usage through aggressive caching and batched loading — MacVitals now takes near-zero CPU between refreshes, safe to keep running for days</li>
    <li>Hovering over pie chart slices no longer triggers expensive redraws, making the UI feel instant</li>
    <li>Subtler selection highlight with a refined edge glow for a cleaner look</li>
</ul>
<h4>Fixed</h4>
<ul>
    <li>Clicking the "Other" pie slice now correctly highlights the matching group in the sidebar</li>
    <li>Sidebar automatically scrolls to the selected item</li>
    <li>Small-app grouping is now proportional to each category's size, so fewer apps get hidden into "Other"</li>
</ul>
            ]]></description>
