            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in 1.3.0</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Menu Bar Monitor</strong> — Quick-glance memory overview directly in your menu bar. Shows top memory consumers without opening the main window. Click to expand into a detachable panel for detailed monitoring while you work.</li>
